Package: GnRHcell
Type: Package
Title: An integrated framework for GnRH neuron identification and developmental trajectory inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Yvon", "Mbouamboua",
        email = "yvon.mbouamboua@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides tools to detect, score, and stage GnRH-like cells in
    single-cell RNA-seq data using gene modules, adaptive scoring,
    ambient RNA correction, and Seurat-compatible workflows.
